module main
description 'Read-only MicroDuck health and typed readings from one snapshot. Each reading is [status, value, unit, origin]. Simulation values are labelled simulation; unmarked never proves physical measurement. Missing data stays unknown. Read the reported health verdict and IMU convergence state, not a universal safe-to-move flag. No sound, skill, enable, policy or motion command is issued.'
variables reply batteryReading orientationReading

script 50 50 {
    whenStarted
    reply = (microduckHealth)
    sayIt reply
    batteryReading = (microduckBatteryPercent reply)
    orientationReading = (microduckImuState reply)
    sayIt batteryReading
    sayIt orientationReading
}

script 350 50 ('[microduck:configured]')
